{
  "name": "ASD 05 · CRM Sync (Airtable · Notion · Supabase)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "3e07f9c3-d95f-5d7c-a1e2-5c67c6a7f5f5",
      "name": "Note · Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 05 · CRM Sync\n**Trigger:** the app POSTs `crm.sync` with `{ trigger, lead, proposal, links }` on every lifecycle change.\n\nEnable the targets you use in ⚙️ Config — each upserts on the lead **Reference** so records never duplicate:\n- **Airtable** — `PATCH /v0/{base}/{table}` with `performUpsert` · credential *ASD · Airtable* (personal access token)\n- **Notion** — query the database by Reference, then update or create the page · credential *ASD · Notion*\n- **Supabase** — `POST /rest/v1/crm_contacts?on_conflict=lead_reference` (table in `supabase/migrations`) · credential *ASD · Supabase CRM*\n\nRecord ids are reported back (`crm.synced`) and shown on the lead in the dashboard.\nField names & Notion property types: see README → CRM sync.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 400,
        "color": 6
      }
    },
